<line><ci>Approximate <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>srne_from</in>  to  <in>srne_to</in></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line>Standardized rate ratio = <in>srr</in></line>
<line><ci>Approximate <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>srr_from</in>  to  <in>srr_to</in></ci></line>
